      <description>&lt;p&gt;I redesigned my homepage with one goal: minimal but high-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Changes I made:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduced a cleaner visual system with stronger typography hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unified cards, spacing, and section rhythm for better readability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a dedicated &lt;code&gt;My Blogs&lt;/code&gt; page to track what I read and learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This page will continue to serve as a public learning journal.&lt;/p&gt;
